{"analysis":{"code_ref":"train.py GPT.init_weights (gate init block) vs CausalSelfAttention.__init__","method":"static code review during PK-memory implementation; confirmed by grep (0 occurrences of fourgram_gate in init_weights) and by the to_empty() construction path"},"artifact_paths":[],"assessment":{"limitations":["invalidates rather than reverses: the true 4-gram effect is unknown"],"relation":"opposes","strength":"strong"},"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-07-22T21:45:00-07:00","created_by":"claude-review","evidence_id":"evd_run_fourgram_gate_bug","experiment_id":"exp_ngram128_fourgram_discovery","facts":{"result":"CODE DEFECT invalidating these 10 runs: fourgram_gate was never initialized in GPT.init_weights. init_weights explicitly zero-inits ve_gate, bigram_gate, trigram_gate and head_gate but omitted fourgram_gate, and the model is built on meta then materialized with model.to_empty(device) -- so the gate held UNINITIALIZED GPU memory for every run with NGRAM_FOURGRAM_MULT>0. The forward applies 2*sigmoid(fourgram_gate(x)) as a multiplicative gate on the entire 4-gram value-embedding contribution, so the 4-gram signal was injected through a random, uncontrolled gate. All 4-gram outcome values from these runs are therefore untrustworthy and the derived conclusion 'n-gram order is redundant with hash-bucket capacity' is retracted. Default runs are unaffected (fourgram off -> gate is None). FIXED: guarded torch.nn.init.zeros_ added alongside the other gates; byte-identical for all default runs."},"fingerprint":"e5f98cba9f366200","hypothesis_ids":["hyp_ngram128_plus_fourgram"],"paper_ids":[],"run_ids":["run_exp_ngram_fourgram_p_baseline_s42_903a6ad9d52977a4","run_exp_ngram_fourgram_p_fourgram_256_s42_8eddd00add2d9396","run_exp_ngram128_fourgra_cap256_s43_4d4c4e84c9b76fe4","run_exp_ngram128_fourgra_cap256_s44_a7efe8ae20e27424","run_exp_ngram128_fourgra_cap256_s45_94e265e8ce99d474","run_exp_ngram128_fourgra_cap128_fg256_s44_6ea0c3d0878c90ee","run_exp_ngram128_fourgra_cap128_fg256_s45_5156dde3f7ddef49","run_exp_ngram128_fourgra_cap128_fg256_s43_111e50f6b2ac4d40","run_exp_ngram128_fourgra_cap256_s46_a62bbb75a191d392","run_exp_ngram128_fourgra_cap128_fg256_s46_35483e207eeee8f2"],"source_type":"internal_run","supersedes_evidence_id":"","tags":["bug","fourgram","retraction","invalid"],"trust":{"design":"strong","directness":"strong","limitations":["distortion magnitude unquantified -- depends on the garbage values in memory"],"replication":"strong","scope_match":"strong"}}
